            "matched_surface": "classification task",
            "positive_evidence_eligible": true,
            "sentence_id": "sentence_42828c4350def50b44f169e0",
            "source_text": "(Refer to :numref:`sec_softmax` for a more detailed explanation.)\nOne natural way to express the classification task is via the probabilistic question: what is the most likely label given the features (i.e., image pixels)?",
